{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-26","kind":"proposition","title":"平行方形的内减一平行方形其减形与元形相似而体势等又一角同则减形必依元形的对…","englishTitle":"If from a parallelogram there be taken away a parallelogram similar and similarly situated to the whole and having a common angle with it, it is about the same diameter with the whole","book":6,"number":26,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.26","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.26/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":26,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","contentId":"euclid-6-26","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b82cfe16217d99380c6089665339c9f15036e99fbe1058fc2a5e25d5f110fc4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-26.statement","euclid-6-26.proof.1","euclid-6-26.proof.2","euclid-6-26.proof.3","euclid-6-26.proof.4","euclid-6-26.proof.5","euclid-6-26.proof.6","euclid-6-26.proof.7","euclid-6-26.conclusion","euclid-6-26.historical.1","euclid-6-26.historical.2","euclid-6-26.historical.3","euclid-6-26.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-26.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d438c397607cd0b44e2c00efa63734d4385d1f612dd45ecd9d5d5faeb61c583","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a parallelogram there be taken away a parallelogram similar and similarly situated to the whole and having a common angle with it, it is about the same diameter with the whole"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从平行四边形公路上 取走一个类似和类似位置的平行四边形公路 并且与整个公路上 有着相同的角度"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"平行方形之内减一平行方形其减形与元形相似而体势等又一角同则减形必依元形之对角线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从一个平行四边形中减去一个平行四边形。如果减去的形式与原始形式相似但形状相同，并且角度相同，则减去的形式必须沿原始形式的对角线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f24b0cf87d4c6ccaa2b7e06ec7256b76aaea8056b37c71c5879acf2a038f1b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the parallelogram ABCD let there be taken away the parallelogram AF similar and similarly situated to ABCD, and having the angle DAB common with it; I say that ABCD is about the same diameter with AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从平行四边形 ABCD, 取走平行四边形 AF, 类似和类似, 与ABCD, 角度DAB相同; 我说, ABCD对角线与AF大致相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e30c04a8c10e122096d03676fe66a6b6ca13c20c14d3c8fa5984603be097ca0d","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose it is not, but, if possible, let AHC be the diameter lt of ABCD gt, let GF be produced and carried through to H, and let HK be drawn through H parallel to either of the straight lines AD, BC. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设不是,但如果可能的话,直径为AHC,直径为ABCDgt,GF伸展并穿过H,HK通过H,与AD和BC直线的一条线平行。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cb3f3fa94c42c6ef81bd40dda8970b7386b992e31c99b89aaf90cf83743b64f","citations":["euclid-6-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, ABCD is about the same diameter with KG, therefore, as DA is to AB, so is GA to AK. [[VI. 24](/principles/euclid-6-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABCD的直径与KG直径大致相同,DA比AB等于GA比AK；DA 与 AB 之比等于 GA 与 AK 之比。 [[VI. 24](/principles/euclid-6-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e01e7549dc720f4eac0f38766039a62374052bc9ff22f2a0307839720ca5e4a","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But also, because of the similarity of ABCD, EG, as DA is to AB, so is GA to AE; therefore also, as GA is to AK, so is GA to AE. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,由于ABCD,EG的相似性,DA对AB的比等于GA对AE的比;因此,GA对AK的比等于GA对AE的比；DA 与 AB 之比等于 GA 与 AE 之比；GA 与 AK 之比等于 GA 与 AE 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"819f3231f516c95757484750165edcca11f05017cc0fdf204a0cb41e0e4004e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore GA has the same ratio to each of the straight lines AK, AE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GA直线与AK、AE直线各有相同比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c44f847ccecda334c9dca8369dad7108473a4e75ef8e3a40b5050ab6c38451e8","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AE is equal to AK [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)], the less to the greater : which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE等于AK,数量小于数量大为:这是不可能的。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16414efe8a872d88a0828a92e72b3c6654a39ca5cbcb809e50ae3e462b4c0de5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore ABCD cannot but be about the same diameter with AF; therefore the parallelogram ABCD is about the same diameter with the parallelogram AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABCD型对角线不能与AF型对角线大致相同;因此,平行四边形型ABCD型对角线与平行四边形、AF型对角线大致相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2c6461960fb26f2a14e7038c99b41dbb15df59ee23ee96e71e037cec783dfe8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"平行方形之内减一平行方形其减形与元形相似而体势等又一角同则减形必依元形之对角线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从一个平行四边形中减去一个平行四边形。如果减去的形式与原始形式相似但形状相同，并且角度相同，则减去的形式必须沿原始形式的对角线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ceefdb7047f03a63f7122c2d9a09997cd06577dde290d2dc6ae333f254122132","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：乙丁平行方形之内减戊庚平行方形元形减形相似而体势等又戊甲庚同角题言戊庚形必依乙丁形之对角线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：乙丁 平行四边形减去 戊庚 平行四边形，其减去的形状但纵横比相等。 戊甲庚 相同角度的命题解释 戊庚 形状必须沿 乙丁 的对角线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9334979c2340f43c58705dbe6f4523ecf2aae4a4544c2b9fe1005b6a882c743","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作甲己己丙对角两线若两线为一直线即显戊庚形依甲丙对角线矣如云甲己己丙非一直线令别作元形之对角线而分戊己边于辛即作辛壬线与己庚平行其乙丁戊壬两平行方形既同依甲辛丙一直对角线则宜相似而体势等矣〈本篇廿四〉是乙甲与甲丁之比例宜若戊甲与甲壬也夫乙甲与甲丁元若戊甲与甲庚〈元设形相似而体势等〉今若所云则戊甲与甲庚亦若戊甲与甲壬矣〈五卷十一〉而甲壬分与甲庚全亦等矣〈五卷九〉可乎若云甲辛丙分己庚于辛即令作辛壬与己戊平行依前论驳之"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：假设 甲己己丙 有两条对角线；如果两条线是直的，那么 戊庚 的形状将根据 甲丙 的对角线展示。例如，甲己己丙 不是直线，因此使用原形的独立对角线。如果 戊己 在边上，辛 制作成与 辛壬 和 己庚 平行。由于 乙丁戊壬 上的两个平行四边形相同，根据 甲辛丙 的直对角线，它们应相似但形状相等。〈本篇廿四〉 是 乙甲 与 甲丁 的比例，因此如果 辛壬 是 乙甲 与 甲丁 的比例就是合适的。戊甲 和 甲壬 与 乙甲 和 甲丁 相同。如果 戊甲 和 甲庚〈元设形相似而体势等〉 如前所述，则 戊甲 和 甲庚 类似于 戊甲 和 甲壬；〈五卷十一〉 和 甲壬 都等于 甲庚，因此 〈五卷九〉 是可接受的。如果 甲辛丙 被分为 己庚 和 辛，那么 辛壬 和 己戊 应该平行，并且前述论点应被反驳。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-26.source","contentId":"euclid-6-26","revisionId":"euclid-6-26@raw-5b82cfe16217d993","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"380105085a0aab814f2e6dfb75125402d3176f4f7a2f69944db7a8d071fb89f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.26/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.26\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-26:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-26.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-26:euclid-6-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-26.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.26","sourceUrl":